* operator + motion = applies the action to the entirity of the movement

MOVEMENT
w - movement; goes to the beginning of next word
b - movement; goes to the beginning of previous word
e - movement; goes to the end of next word
0 - movement; start of the line
$ - movement; end of the line
gg - movement; beginning of file
G - movement; end of file
% - movement; move to the matching parenthesis
OPERATORS
d - operator; delete
c - operator; delete and go into insert mode
o - operator; add a ine below the current line and go into insert mode
r<char> - operator; replace character with <char>

SHORTCUTS / FREEQUENTS
x - shortcut; delete character under cursor
dd - shortcut; delete entire line
d$ - shortcut; delete entire line after cursor
d0 - shortcut; delete entire line before cursor
d2w - shortcut; delete 2 words
a - shortcut; insert character before cursor
yap - shortcut; yank the whole paragraph
